+ *   bluedpu_flip=1 (default 0)  present without copying: AppleCLCD::swap
+ *              points the staged SSPPs at backboardd's surface when it is
+ *              one full-screen 1125x2436 BGRA layer in physically
+ *              contiguous memory below 4 GiB, cleaned to PoC first (the DPU
+ *              is not IO-coherent). Geometry follows bluefb_fit: fit by
+ *              QSEED3 (default) or the centre crop (bluefb_fit=0, no
+ *              scaler). The first flip writes the geometry, later ones only
+ *              the two source addresses, then CTL_FLUSH; SwapEnd returns
+ *              once the flush latched (CTL_FLUSH bits clear at the next
+ *              frame start, bounded 50 ms; bluedpu_flip_wait=0 returns at
